<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-044" chapter-id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children" source-id="s-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children-ws2376749">
  <p id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">世祖諸男：<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001:m0005" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn_AA">徐妃</persName>生忠壯世子<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001:m0012" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w_A">方等</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001:m0015" ref="9ji_nha_sct">王夫人</persName>生貞惠世子<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001:m0023" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w_C">方諸</persName></p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">忠壯世子<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p002:m0004" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w_A">方等</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p002:m0008" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w_A">實相</persName>，世祖長子也。母曰<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p002:m0019" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn_AA">徐妃</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">及至麻溪，河東王率軍逆戰，<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p003:m0013" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w_A">方等</persName>擊之，軍敗，遂溺死，時年二十二。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">貞惠世子<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004:m0004" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w_C">方諸</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004:m0008" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w_C">智相</persName>，世祖第二子。母<persName id="c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004:m0018" ref="9ji_nha_sct">王夫人</persName>。</p>
</text>
